      "content": "it's just that \"path out\" always leads back to the same place. i wake up, i struggle, i fail, i feel like absolute shit, and repeat. it's not even a path, it's a loop. i feel like i'm just wasting everyone's time and mine too. what's the point of even fighting if the outcome is always gonna be this?",
